E AX3042 1462-lambda-field-effects.ax:7:6-12 undeclared-effect "`sneaky` performs IO and its declaration does not say so" !"effects are INFERRED transitively, so this fires on every function up the call chain, and each one is a place a reader would otherwise have to open the callee to learn it. If the effect is not wanted here the fix is to stop performing it, not to stop saying so. `IO`, `Entropy`, `Spawn` and `Block` are required; `Alloc` and `Mut` are ambient and never need declaring" ?7:1:"write `;@axiom:effect(io)` above the declaration"~>";@axiom:effect(io)\n"
